<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Telebras 3.2 bln real profit in 96.</title>
<headline>Brazil Telebras 3.2 bln real profit in 96.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state telecommunications firm Telebras made a profit of 3.2 billion reais in 1996, Communications Minister Sergio Motta said.</p>
<p>Motta gave no further details. Telebras itself has said it did not expect to give final 1996 figures before March.</p>
</text>
